      "no_speech_prob": 0.003592
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 7.43,
      "end": 12.96,
      "text": "But then humans started burning fossil fuels around here",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003592
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 15.78,
      "end": 20.94,
      "text": "Today global temperatures have risen about one degree Celsius since pre-industrial times",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003592
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 21.58,
      "end": 23.74,
      "text": "This is what that looks like so far",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003592
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 25.42,
      "end": 27.42,
      "text": "Storms have gotten more intense",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003592
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 28.5,
      "end": 30.5,
      "text": "wildfires are more common and",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003592
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 31.26,
      "end": 34.46,
      "text": "Ancient glaciers are melting faster and faster",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.229238,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001838
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 35.66,
      "end": 39.62,
      "text": "And that's just one degree of warming without global action",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.229238,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001838
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 39.62,
      "end": 46.3,
      "text": "The world is on track to warm at least three degrees Celsius by 2100. This would be catastrophic",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.229238,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001838
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 46.98,
      "end": 54.62,
      "text": "That's why most scientists agree that we need to limit global warming to this range between 1.5 and 2 degrees Celsius",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.229238,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001838
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 55.42,
      "end": 62.74,
      "text": "Carbon dioxide, which is emitted when we burn fossil fuels accounts for most of the world's greenhouse gas emissions",
