      "avg_logprob": -0.190883,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005219
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 63.06,
      "end": 69.94,
      "text": "It's the main culprit behind climate change and to limit global warming to the degree that scientists are calling for",
